OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FScattered
OL,6,Fshowers this evening will clear, with
OL,7,Fa dry night following and long clear
OL,8,Fperiods. Winds gradually ease, but
OL,9,Fcoastal areas will stay fairly breezy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FLargely dry during daytime
OL,12,Fwith some good sunny spells,
OL,13,Fespecially in the morning. More in the
OL,14,Fway of cloud through the afternoon
OL,15,Fahead of patchy rain arriving by
OL,16,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
